{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校からのお友達に誕生日メッセージを書きました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN29CKAX8ZVCDY7TYC4F0AF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n誕生日の子の似顔絵と、その子の大好きな猫とチョコとお茶。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりお手紙書いたなあ。\nお手紙書くの、結構楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"閉じるとラブレター風。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN29DYXGHK51FJWK64R3KMB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は、この猫はメッセージの紙で隠れてて、手紙のフタを閉じると、耳と手だけが覗いてる感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手を振ってる感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでもらえたいいなあ･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙会やりたい!書いてあげたい。\nほしいひと、いますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もらってくださいp畄q(´∀`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまご観察日記4日目"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN29F6C7X16T0NHC3BVBA2Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変化なし、、、。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN29GD5E3CSY71VJFP6QNQ1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n毎日お水あげてるのになあ。\n悲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しかなあ 、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日の友達とご飯に行きました。\n飯テロ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN29HWT2RNKQPZY5S1SDDWG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nチーズタッカルビ。\n流行りらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN29JZWXC5E8QCSA0J6TQMG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n生チョコアイス。\n左からあずき、黒ごま、きなこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、きな粉が一番すき!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せでひた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}